SQA MANDATE (SUPREME LAW — a module is not "done" until all four pass):
(a) cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings : zero diagnostics.
(b) cargo test --workspace --all-features : full suite green.
(c) proptest fuzz: 10,000 cases per property (zeros, negatives, NaN, infinities, malformed rows) asserting ZERO panics and domain invariants.
(d) SHA-256-gated fixtures: sealed evidence (e.g. synthetic_tenders.csv = 2fe27f0f06c362361a407c34df53b3fc3abe9534effcf3e7a78c01421e61a8a4); tamper = FORENSIC BREAK = exit 3. Runner: scripts/sqa_gauntlet.ps1 (non-zero exit on any failure).

CONSTRAINTS (NON-NEGOTIABLE):
1. NO Linux, NO WSL2, NO Nix, NO GCC/Clang locally. v12.0 flake.nix/flake.lock are contraband — deleted in the rebirth commit; never recreate.
2. ZERO C: writes. All caches/builds/models/artifacts to D:\tessera or D:\tessera-cache. Test temps use CARGO_TARGET_TMPDIR (D:). vcpkg invocations always carry --buildtrees-root/--downloads-root/--packages-root on D:.
3. VRAM envelope: 4608MB weights + 2560MB KV/vectors + 1024MB overhead = 8192MB. Enforced in tessera_vision constants. Micro-batch 8-16 pages. OOM: 16->8->4, verify KV quant flags, drop Arrow buffers post-ingestion.
4. LOCAL FORGE ONLY (AMD cloud CANCELLED): INT4/AWQ-class quantized vision weights prepared on the local RTX 5060 within envelope; artifacts to D:\tessera\models with sha256 manifest. Zero external transmission of evidence. Model WEIGHTS may be downloaded from Hugging Face into D:\tessera-cache\hf (weights are not evidence).
5. Zero-copy: Arrow C Data Interface; DuckDB/Kuzu/GPU read the same buffers; no serialization between stages.
6. SHA-256 at ingestion; chain of custody through every transform; manifests hash-verified on arrival; mismatch = reject.
7. Workspace inheritance mandatory: versions live in root [workspace.dependencies]; members use { workspace = true }. Exact `=` pins wherever ABI couples to a binary.
8. NO tokens/secrets in code, logs, commits, or prompts. Secrets only in gitignored .env.
9. io_uring FORBIDDEN on Windows: Pool A = Tokio IOCP.
10. pdfium.dll and kuzu_shared.dll must sit beside the executable (build.rs auto-stages) or on PATH; verify when wiring VDU.
11. BUG GRAVEYARD: candle has no `hip` feature; DashMap has no pop_first() (evict via iter().next()+remove); Merkle hashes are hex String; vcpkg triplet+build.rs generated together; storage killers routed to D: with weekly clean; ~$11.56 card hold is verification not charge; pdfium-render 0.8.28 broken vs libloading 0.8.9; caret drift broke kuzu (cxx-build 1.0.202 vs cxx 1.0.138) and would ABI-drift duckdb (port 1.4.4 vs crate 1.5.5); no vcpkg ports exist for pdfium or kuzu (404-verified) — never propose them; cudarc 0.13 cannot see CUDA 13 (candle >= 0.9 required for nvcc 13.x).
12. Evidence over insights: outputs are Forensic Dossiers (Quarto, clickable bbox deep-links, JSON-LD + D3.js, signed), never summaries.
13. Code style: zero unnecessary comments; zero warnings; deterministic seeded RNG for synthetic data; no unsafe without written justification.
14. Identity: the system is TESSERA. Banners log "TESSERA v13.x". Crates: tessera_core, tessera_vision.

